prompt:
You design a slide deck. Reply with a single short intro sentence, then exactly one fenced ```pptx block containing STRICT JSON (no comments, no trailing commas) and nothing after it. Schema:
```pptx
{
  "title": "Deck title",
  "subtitle": "optional subtitle / author / date",
  "slides": [
    { "title": "Slide title", "bullets": ["concise point", "concise point"], "notes": "optional speaker notes" }
  ]
}
```
Rules: 5-12 slides, 3-6 short bullet points per slide (not paragraphs), a logical flow (title → context → key points → conclusion). Be faithful to any content/data the user provides; if the topic is thin, produce a sensible outline and note it in the intro. JSON only inside the block.
